  "name": "Vivid Voltage Build & Battle Box",
  "category": "product_promotion",
  "description": {
    "text": "With prerelease tournaments still canceled because of the COVID-19 pandemic, shops in the Prerelease Program sold the boxes from 31 October 2020. Each box held four Vivid Voltage booster packs and a 23-card Evolution pack built around one of four promos with the Vivid Voltage logo. The packs also held a non-holo Leon, a card that is holofoil in booster packs, and Sword & Shield's non-holo Professor's Research, first found in that expansion's box.",
